        "node_id": "n_1_d02257",
        "thought_text": "The error in the previous solution was that it didn't correctly handle the case where a tree is already colored. The DP table was not being updated properly for colored trees, which led to incorrect results. Let's modify the approach to correctly account for both colored and uncolored trees in our dynamic programming solution.",
