        "node_id": "n_3_39870b",
        "thought_text": "The current approach of generating all possible colorings for uncolored trees is inefficient and incorrect due to the 0-based indexing of colors. Instead, we should use dynamic programming to find the minimum paint cost while ensuring the beauty constraint is met. This approach will be more efficient and correct.",
